target: internal/record/record.go
verify: go test ./internal/record/ -count=1 -run 'TestTailLimitKeepsTheNewestRows'
expect: the tail dropped the newest run
why:    taking the first n lines instead of the last makes every derived answer describe runs that have already scrolled away, while looking exactly as healthy
--- old
	if limit > 0 && len(lines) > limit {
		lines = lines[len(lines)-limit:]
	}
--- new
	if limit > 0 && len(lines) > limit {
		lines = lines[:limit]
	}
